{"dog":{"age_group":"adult","application_url":"https://petstablished.com/public/search/redirect?application_type=adoption&pet_id=2860876&premium=true","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Medium mixed breed","breed_primary":"Mixed Breed","description_text":"Meet Xola! You'll come for her tiny smushy face and curly q piglet tail, and stay for her personality that feels like a warm ray of sunshine on a cloudy day - a best friend through and through. 2 year old, 48 lb Xola is equal parts snuggle bug and adventure buddy, and an absolute joy to be around.\n\nXola takes a beat to warm up to new people, but give her a little patience (and preferably lots of treats!) and she melts into the sweetest, most affectionate velcro dog who just wants to be near her person. She loves giving hugs, and they are truly the best thing to experience after a long day - she lays right on top of you and falls asleep listening to your heartbeat. While she loves being near her person, she's also perfectly happy entertaining herself with her beloved chews and stuffies and is a pro at regulating and settling indoors on her own.\n\nAs if her personality wasn't perfect enough, Xola is also a wonderful house guest! She is fully housetrained and crate trained - her crate is her safe space and she sleeps in there overnight, naps there during the day, and does wonderfully home alone crated for the duration of a full workday. On leash she's a lovely easygoing walker, mostly unfazed by all the city chaos (but loves a good sniff!). She's friendly and respectful with other dogs, loves car rides and bath time, and despite her young age, is a wonderful medium between easygoing and playful - making her incredibly adaptable to many kinds of households.\n\nXola is incredibly smart, a food-motivated learner, and genuinely fun to train - she already knows the cues \"sit\", \"stay\", \"crate\", \"down\", \"touch\", \"stop\", and \"go\", as well as a variety of pattern games. Her foster parents are currently helping her polish up some manners like her playful mouthiness when excited (which she easily redirects from with a toy or chew!), and learning that strangers can be as safe as the people she knows and loves.\n\nXola will be a lucky someone's soul dog through every ordinary day and big adventure - she is ready to thrive in a forever home!","detail_url":"https://petstablished.com/public/search/pet/2860876","id":"dd78d8683c82d9d382b5b9fb3605c926","image_urls":["https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/petstablished-app-beta/uploads/image/image/6303675/IMG_7671.jpg","https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/petstablished-app-beta/uploads/image/image/6275510/IMG_6707_VSCO.jpg","https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/petstablished-app-beta/uploads/image/image/6302090/img_6235_vsco_1024.jpg","https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/petstablished-app-beta/uploads/image/image/6302091/img_6215_vsco_1024.jpg","https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/petstablished-app-beta/uploads/image/image/6297704/img_7472_1024-1.jpg","https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/petstablished-app-beta/uploads/image/image/6302092/img_6228_vsco_1024.jpg","https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/petstablished-app-beta/uploads/image/image/6288925/FullSizeRender_VSCO.jpeg","https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/petstablished-app-beta/uploads/image/image/6229039/IMG_6639.jpg","https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/petstablished-app-beta/uploads/image/image/6260788/img_5960_vsco_1024.jpg","https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/petstablished-app-beta/uploads/image/image/6269960/IMG_6453_VSCO.jpg","https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/petstablished-app-beta/uploads/image/image/6260789/img_5966_vsco_1024.jpg","https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/petstablished-app-beta/uploads/image/image/6245302/FullSizeRender_VSCO.jpeg","https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/petstablished-app-beta/uploads/image/image/6245303/FullSizeRender_VSCO__1_.jpeg","https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/petstablished-app-beta/uploads/image/image/6260790/img_5956_vsco_1024.jp